| `IMPLEMENTATION-BLUEPRINT.md` | Days 52–60, each with objective, learning goals, features, step-by-step plan, files, tools, testing tasks, debugging tips, end-of-day checklist, expected state and handoff notes — plus a standing context block and a change log |
