One thing worth noting about the blueprint: my nine-day plan lined up almost exactly with the challenge's own Day 52–60 themes (system design → setup → core features → MVP → refinement → testing → launch → v1.0.0). That was not coordination — it is just what a real software lifecycle looks like when you plan one honestly.

