## ⚠️ Honest Risks

The risk register in the PRD names seven. The three I actually expect to fight:

- **Scope creep into the multi-review register.** It is the most obviously useful next feature and the most dangerous to start early, because the single-review loop has to work first. It is named in the PRD as post-v1.0 so it can be wanted without being built.
- **Framework content taking longer than the app.** Authoring 21 categories with a genuine AI-specific note each is a full day's work. It is Day 54's only deliverable for that reason.
- **No external users by Day 10.** Three named practitioners must be identified by Day 57 and contacted on Day 59. Naming them is a Day 57 checklist item, not an intention.

